# One validated live Cloudflare range list generates one global Nginx file with
# the trusted real-IP directives plus a single `$aidipanel_from_cloudflare`
# classifier. The packaged seed is an immutable fallback; the live list changes
# only after a complete, validated refresh. State is inert `schema=1` key=value
# data, never sourced. Every action serialises on one global flock.

